 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each event [from, chunkList, to] is a successful transfer of the space-separated chunk ids in chunkList from from to to; from is a vehicle id or \"server\", to is always a vehicle id different from from. A vehicle's contribution is the total number of chunk ids it sent over all events (repeats count each time). Return every vehicle id that appears in any event (never \"server\"), ordered by contribution descending, then by id ascending in character code order.",
